  "part": {
    "name": "Streamlined enclosure with central thumb wheel",
    "description": "A two-solid, mouse-like or handheld streamlined enclosure comprising a smooth asymmetric housing, an integrated rectangular wheel-support pedestal, and a separate rounded thumb wheel. The housing is formed from six large freeform surface patches, while the pedestal and wheel provide the principal mechanical interface.",
